From: "Ilamparithi Murali (ilamparithi-in)" <ilamparithi.in@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 15:42:17 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] feat(clipboard): implement multi-MIME shared clipboard
 bridge

- Add support for text, HTML, and binary images (PNG, JPEG, BMP) across Android and X11
- Implement structured per-target clipboard caching and SelectionNotify delivery for TARGETS
- Add reliable stream reading and writing loops across socket connection to prevent partial read desynchronization
- Fix startup clipboard timestamp check and prevent recursive announcement loops
